         <component>
            <section>
               <id root="aa853c2b-c7b1-f910-e053-2995a90a8f93"/>
               <code code="34067-9" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="INDICATIONS &amp; USAGE SECTION"/>
               <title>INDICATIONS &amp; USAGE</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Temporarily relieves minor aches and pains of muscles and joins associated with: ■ arthritis ■ simple backache ■ bursitis ■ tendonitis
       
 
  <br/>■ strains ■ sprains ■ bruises ■ cramps
      

 </paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20180428"/>
            </section>
         </component>
