               <title>PURPOSE</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Topical Analgesic</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20180427"/>
            </section>
         </component>
         <component>
            <section ID="Lf95ab33f-d2f3-4783-b889-7e33372a61ce">
               <id root="aa853c2b-c7b5-f910-e053-2995a90a8f93"/>
               <code code="50567-7" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="OTC - WHEN USING SECTION"/>
               <title>When using this product</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Use only as directed ■ Don’t bandage tightly or use with heating pad
       
 
  <br/>■ Avoid contact with eyes and mucous membranes ■ Don’t apply to wounds or damaged skin.
      

 </paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20180427"/>
            </section>
         </component>
         <component>
            <section ID="L0d22a9ba-170f-456d-ae8f-d969db107a6f">
               <id root="aa853c2b-c7b6-f910-e053-2995a90a8f93"/>
               <code code="50566-9" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="OTC - STOP USE SECTION"/>
               <title>Stop use and ask a doctor</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>If condition worsens ■ If redness is present ■ If irritation develops
       
 
  <br/>■ If symptoms persist for more than 7 days or clear up and occur again within a few days.
      

 </paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20180427"/>
            </section>
         </component>
